[list]
[*]HBE members without a regular recruitment site receive a capital muster point. Checked at campaign start and monthly for existing saves and capital changes.
[*]All nine specialty regiments retain 500 men, with stronger individual combat and terrain roles. Each net new specialty regiment adds 2 labour burden at the monthly check.
[*]Updated story text and branch continuity across the seven regional arcs, Huguang migration and 33 short chains. Chapters recall prior choices; branch illustrations change during the story. Added short-chain epilogues, bringing the total to 506 visible events.
[*]Added selected historical hover guides and icons for both shared government reforms. Separated unit detail paintings from recruitment portrait sheets.
[*]Regional formables are now named Shu and Yu, alongside Bashu Empire. Revised the Chinese Workshop copy; both Chinese regional pages use the same description.
[/list]
